{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FSvFTCWqVTdHJ2y8fLhNK8","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"Created schemas/Task.md\\ntitle: Task\\npermalink: main/schemas/task\\nchecksum: c5bfe6150d110d1a8673a0d52b7fbafa73cfa26caa88a62a24861c05b4b9fa7b\\n\\n## Similar existing notes\\nThis note looks similar to notes that already exist. Did you mean to write to one of these?\\n- Decision (`schemas/Decision.md`)\\n- Coding Session (`schemas/Coding Session.md`)\\n\\n| If it is... | Then |\\n|---|---|\\n| The same topic | `bm_edit(identifier='schemas/Decision.md', command='append', content='...', project='main')`, then `bm_delete(identifier='schemas/Task.md', project='main')` |\\n| Related but distinct | Add a relation here, e.g. `- relates_to [[Decision]]` |\\n| Unrelated | Nothing to do |\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c1d1031-2506-47c3-9152-95c543fd6905","uuid":"39e204de-cc65-457e-9542-183a10d72240","timestamp":"2026-11-02T22:37:28.563Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"Created schemas/Task.md\\ntitle: Task\\npermalink: main/schemas/task\\nchecksum: c5bfe6150d110d1a8673a0d52b7fbafa73cfa26caa88a62a24861c05b4b9fa7b\\n\\n## Similar existing notes\\nThis note looks similar to notes that already exist. Did you mean to write to one of these?\\n- Decision (`schemas/Decision.md`)\\n- Coding Session (`schemas/Coding Session.md`)\\n\\n| If it is... | Then |\\n|---|---|\\n| The same topic | `bm_edit(identifier='schemas/Decision.md', command='append', content='...', project='main')`, then `bm_delete(identifier='schemas/Task.md', project='main')` |\\n| Related but distinct | Add a relation here, e.g. `- relates_to [[Decision]]` |\\n| Unrelated | Nothing to do |\"}","_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Basic Memory","version":"4.1.3"},"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"Created schemas/Task.md\ntitle: Task\npermalink: main/schemas/task\nchecksum: c5bfe6150d110d1a8673a0d5