{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TWebztVkVJpxPeoszmZRGu","type":"tool_result","content":"---\ntitle: Coding Session\ntype: schema\npermalink: main/schemas/coding-session\nentity: CodingSession\nversion: 1\nschema:\n  summary?: string, one-paragraph what happened in this coding session\n  changed_file?(array): string, files created, edited, deleted, or inspected\n  verification?(array): string, checks run and their result\n  decision?(array): string, decisions surfaced or created during the session\n  blocker?(array): string, unresolved blockers or failed approaches\n  next_step?(array): string, explicit cursor for the next coding session\n  produced?(array): Entity, notes or artifacts created or updated\nsettings:\n  validation: warn\n  frontmatter:\n    project: string, the Basic Memory project this session belongs to\n    started: string, when the session began or checkpoint was created\n    repository: string, stable repository identifier such as owner/name\n    repo_root: string, Git repository root for this checkout\n    cwd: string, working directory for the session\n    branch: string, checked-out Git branch or HEAD when detached\n    git_sha: string, exact Git commit at checkpoint time\n    ended?: string, when the session was checkpointed\n    status?(enum, lifecycle of the checkpoint):\n    - open\n    - resumed\n    - closed\n    pull_request_number?: string, current pull request number as a queryable identifier\n/tmp/ep-pwe7uls8/home/basic-memory/schemas/Coding Session.md:0\n/tmp/ep-pwe7uls8/home/basic-memory/schemas/Decision.md:0\n/tmp/ep-pwe7uls8/home/basic-memory/schemas/Task.md:0","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c1d1031-2506-47c3-9152-95c543fd6905","uuid":"78c12ea2-e9bb-43eb-9936-c1cf1324a7e0","timestamp":"2026-11-02T22:37:51.626Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"---\ntitle: Coding Session\ntype: schema\npermalink: main/schemas/coding-session\nentity: CodingSession\nversion: 1\nschema:\n  summary?: string, one-paragraph what happened in this coding session\n  changed_file?(array): string, files created, edited, deleted, or inspected\n  verification?(array): string, checks run and their result\n  decision?(array): string, decisions surfaced or created during the session\n  blocker?(array): string, unresolved blockers or failed approaches\n  next_step?(array): string, explicit cursor for the next coding session\n  produced?(array): Entity, notes or artifacts created or updated\nsettings:\n  validation: warn\n  frontmatter:\n    project: string, the Basic Memory project this session belongs to\n    started: string, when the session began or checkpoint was created\n    repository: string, stable repository identifier such as owner/name\n    repo_root: string, Git repository root for this checkout\n    cwd: string, working directory for the session\n    branch: string, checked-out Git branch or HEAD when detached\n    git_sha: string, exact Git commit at checkpoint time\n    ended?: string, when the session was checkpointed\n    status?(enum, lifecycle of the checkpoint):\n    - open\n    - resumed\n    - closed\n    pull_request_number?: string, current pull request number as a queryable identifier\n/tmp/ep-pwe7uls8/home/basic-memory/schemas/Coding Session.md:0\n/tmp/ep-pwe7uls8/home/basic-memory/schemas/Decision.md:0\n/tmp/ep-pwe7uls8/home/basic-memory/schemas/Task.md:0","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"returnCodeInterpretation":"No matches found","noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01TWebztVkVJpxPeoszmZRGu","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgeuK4V8t5gjQNwpcoqK2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Setup is done. The one deviation is that I used your existing `main` project instead of creating a `ufo` project.\n\n- **Project:** `~/basic-memory` already belongs to `main`, and projects can't nest, so creating `ufo` there failed. `main` was empty and is now `primaryProject`.\n- **Profile:** coding, with `repository` set to `ufo`, the directory name, since there's no git remote.\n- **Schemas:** I seeded Coding Session, Decision and Task into `schemas/`. None existed before. The frontmatter on disk is nested correctly, with no `[object Object]` corruption.\n- **Placement:** this is a suggested starting structure, since the project was empty. It uses `schemas/`, `decisions/`, `tasks/`, `sessions/` and `bm-remember/`, and the folders appear as notes land.\n- **Settings:** I wrote them to `.claude/settings.local.json`, which is personal and not gitignored, so it shows as untracked in `git status`. Lifecycle-event capture is on, and the `basic-memory` output style is on.\n- **Shared skills:** I installed the `memory-*` skills globally with `npx skills add`.\n- **Smoke test:**\n  - The open-decision query returns cleanly with 0 results.\n  - The schema query lists all three schemas.\n  - `bm hook status` finds the settings and reports project `main`, profile coding and capture on.\n  - The shared hook inbox has 1 pending envelope, 0 archived, and has never been flushed.\n- **PreCompact:** `hook status` reports \"checkpoint on compact: off\". I didn't change that, and I left `preCompactCapture` at the template default of `extractive`, which doesn't match what the status shows. If you want checkpoints on compaction, check that setting.\n\nRestart the session to activate the proactive-capture reflexes from the output style. Recall already works in this session, and the PreCompact checkpoint is subject to the se